5 - Files
    -----

    L002_00_Premises.v

      All semantic carriers and interfaces: `AsIF`, mirror positions,
      consistency, world/brain/model soundness, witnessed control questions,
      recognition, fixed regulators, finite operation, attribution, provenance,
      and externalization.

    L002_01__Mirror_Unrefutability.v

      Fixed-point irrefutability, recognition re-entry, collapse, and mirror
      opacity, including the L001 specialization.

    L002_02__Recursive_Mirror_Lemma.v

      Finite iteration of a formula-level mirror operation, with
      irrefutability and recognition opacity at every adequate iterate, plus
      the operational yes/no/re-entry process and its bounded and unbounded
      control outcomes.

    L002_03__Symbolic_Regulation.v

      Consequences and concrete constructions over the premise interfaces:
      finite recurrence, logical recurrence, provenance observations,
      attribution, ambiguity, and externalization.

    L002_95_API.v

      Stable public theorem and contract surface.

    L002_97_Artifacts.v

      Certified endpoints and redirected assumption reports.

    L002_98_Sanity.v

      Compile-time probes for the public API.

